# The arp's rate under two cables, LFO 1 and velocity, whose sum saturates: the matrix adds them to the arp's own rate.
# Format: <frame> <hex MIDI bytes>; frames are offline-render sample offsets.
4608 90 3C 64
9000 90 40 64
13000 90 43 64
30000 80 40 40
34000 90 47 64
50000 80 3C 40
56000 90 48 64
70000 80 43 40
70000 80 47 40
70000 80 48 40
